{"kind":"html","caption":"用后序遍历自底向上计算深度：空节点深度为 0，每个非空节点的深度等于左右子树深度的较大值加 1。示例中先得到叶子节点 9、15、7 的深度，再合并出节点 20 的深度 2，最终根节点 3 得到最大深度 3。动画中的蓝色节点表示当前正在计算的位置，虚线高亮表示最终最长路径。","html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>二叉树的最大深度</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}main{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 10px 10px;display:grid;gap:8px}.panel{background:#252526;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;padding:8px 10px}.intro{line-height:1.45;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:12px}.tree{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(40px,1fr));grid-template-rows:auto auto auto;gap:8px 6px}.node-wrap{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:4px}.node{width:40px;min-height:40px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:#2d2d30;font:600 12px \"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;transition:background .35s,border-color .35s}.meta{min-height:28px;text-align:center;line-height:1.35;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:10px}.mono{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}.n3{grid-column:1/5;grid-row:1}.n9{grid-column:1/3;grid-row:2}.n20{grid-column:3/5;grid-row:2}.n15{grid-column:3;grid-row:3}.n7{grid-column:4;grid-row:3}.node-wrap.current .node{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}.node-wrap.done .node{border-color:#3794ff;color:#3794ff}.node-wrap.path .node{outline:1px dashed #3794ff;outline-offset:2px}.status{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:6px}.card{background:#2d2d30;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;padding:8px 10px;min-height:auto}.label{color:#3794ff;margin-bottom:4px;font-size:10px}.formula{font:11px/1.45 \"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;color:#d4d4d4}.formula strong{color:#fff;background:#0e639c;border-radius:4px;padding:1px 4px}.result{font:600 16px \"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;color:#3794ff}.steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:4px}.step{border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;padding:6px;background:#2d2d30;font-size:10px;line-height:1.35}.step.active{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}.step-index{font:9px \"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;color:#3794ff;margin-bottom:2px}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n<section class=\"panel intro\">示例：<span class=\"mono\">root = [3,9,20,null,null,15,7]</span>。后序遍历先计算左右子树，再用 <span class=\"mono\">max(左深度, 右深度) + 1</span> 得到当前节点深度。</section>\n<section class=\"panel\">\n<div class=\"tree\" aria-label=\"示例二叉树\">\n<div class=\"node-wrap n3\" data-node=\"3\"><div class=\"node\">3</div><div class=\"meta\">根节点<br><span class=\"depth mono\">等待计算</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"node-wrap n9\" data-node=\"9\"><div class=\"node\">9</div><div class=\"meta\">左孩子<br><span class=\"depth mono\">等待计算</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"node-wrap n20\" data-node=\"20\"><div class=\"node\">20</div><div class=\"meta\">右孩子<br><span class=\"depth mono\">等待计算</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"node-wrap n15\" data-node=\"15\"><div class=\"node\">15</div><div class=\"meta\">左孩子<br><span class=\"depth mono\">等待计算</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"node-wrap n7\" data-node=\"7\"><div class=\"node\">7</div><div class=\"meta\">右孩子<br><span class=\"depth mono\">等待计算</span></div></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"status\">\n<div class=\"card\"><div class=\"label\">当前计算</div><div id=\"formula\" class=\"formula\">从叶子节点开始。</div></div>\n<div class=\"card\"><div class=\"label\">当前结论</div><div id=\"result\" class=\"result\">—</div></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"panel\"><div class=\"steps\">\n<div class=\"step\" data-step=\"0\"><div class=\"step-index\">步骤 1</div>叶子 9<br><span class=\"mono\">深度 = 1</span></div>\n<div class=\"step\" data-step=\"1\"><div class=\"step-index\">步骤 2</div>叶子 15<br><span class=\"mono\">深度 = 1</span></div>\n<div class=\"step\" data-step=\"2\"><div class=\"step-index\">步骤 3</div>叶子 7<br><span class=\"mono\">深度 = 1</span></div>\n<div class=\"step\" data-step=\"3\"><div class=\"step-index\">步骤 4</div>合并节点 20<br><span class=\"mono\">深度 = 2</span></div>\n<div class=\"step\" data-step=\"4\"><div class=\"step-index\">步骤 5</div>合并根节点 3<br><span class=\"mono\">深度 = 3</span></div>\n</div></section>\n</main>\n<script>\nconst frames=[\n {node:'9',depths:{'9':1},formula:'节点 9：max(0, 0) + 1 = <strong>1</strong>',result:'1'},\n {node:'15',depths:{'9':1,'15':1},formula:'节点 15：max(0, 0) + 1 = <strong>1</strong>',result:'1'},\n {node:'7',depths:{'9':1,'15':1,'7':1},formula:'节点 7：max(0, 0) + 1 = <strong>1</strong>',result:'1'},\n {node:'20',depths:{'9':1,'15':1,'7':1,'20':2},formula:'节点 20：max(1, 1) + 1 = <strong>2</strong>',result:'2'},\n {node:'3',depths:{'9':1,'15':1,'7':1,'20':2,'3':3},formula:'节点 3：max(1, 2) + 1 = <strong>3</strong>',result:'3',path:true}\n];\nlet index=0;\nfunction render(){\n const f=frames[index];\n document.querySelectorAll('.node-wrap').forEach(el=>{\n  const key=el.dataset.node;\n  el.classList.toggle('current',key===f.node);\n  el.classList.toggle('done',Object.prototype.hasOwnProperty.call(f.depths,key));\n  el.classList.toggle('path',!!f.path&&['3','20','15'].includes(key));\n  el.querySelector('.depth').textContent=f.depths[key]===undefined?'等待计算':'深度 = '+f.depths[key];\n });\n document.querySelectorAll('.step').forEach((el,i)=>el.classList.toggle('active',i===index));\n document.getElementById('formula').innerHTML=f.formula;\n document.getElementById('result').textContent=f.result;\n index=(index+1)%frames.length;\n}\nrender();setInterval(render,1900);\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","svg":"","media":""}
